    {
      "q": "How do I register a change of name?",
      "a": "You can register a change of name through the NSW Registry of Births, Deaths & Marriages.",
      "link": "https://www.service.nsw.gov.au/transaction/register-a-change-of-name"
    },
    {
      "q": "Where can I change my name on various licenses and accounts?",
      "a": "You can change your name on records such as your E-Toll Account, recreational fishing licence, boat/vessel licence, and NSW Seniors Card.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "What if I need to replace a change of name certificate?",
      "a": "You can replace a change of name certificate using the dedicated service.",
